  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text">Various parameters can be adjusted to suit the operation of each facility. Preparation steps can be validated with a single click, indicating whether an order is in progress or completed. The display of the number of visible orders can be configured to show only a manageable volume on the screen, with a scrolling option if the number of orders in progress is too high.</p>
