  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text">The system incorporates clear visual indicators for rapid monitoring of order status. Orders can be color-coded to indicate their progress: a recently received order appears in green, an order that has been on hold for more than three minutes turns orange, and an order that has been on hold for more than ten minutes turns red. These fully-configurable benchmarks help to improve responsiveness in the kitchen and prioritize preparations more effectively.</p>
