      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58a7" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">Questions we're asked about <span class="gradient-text">kitchen screens</span>:</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58ac-6643cc38" data-w-id="9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58ac" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What's the difference between a kitchen screen, a production screen, a KDS and a display screen?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">There aren't any! Kitchen screen, production screen, KDS (or Kitchen Display System) and display screen all serve the same purpose: to make your life in the kitchen easier. The only differences are between software publishers, who offer more or less advanced user interface solutions.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58b7-6643cc38" data-w-id="9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58b7" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How much does a kitchen screen cost?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Innovorder offers subscription-based solutions. To find out the price of a production screen, contact an Innovorder advisor and receive a customized quote based on your restaurant's actual needs.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58c2-6643cc38" data-w-id="9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58c2" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How do you install a production screen in your restaurant kitchen?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our experts take care of everything! Our team will visit your restaurant to install, configure and train your operators in the use of the production screens.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58cd-6643cc38" data-w-id="9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58cd" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Why install a kitchen monitor in your restaurant?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A kitchen screen (or production screen) increases the productivity of your kitchen teams, streamlines the organization of your restaurant and simplifies the daily routine of your preparation staff. All in all, a considerable gain in efficiency.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58d8-6643cc38" data-w-id="9f30e9da-819b-9724-4686-6ebd6eea58d8" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How to choose the right kitchen screen?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To choose the production screen best suited to your restaurant's needs, it's important to check a whole series of criteria: the size of your kitchen and your establishment, the number of workstations to be equipped, your sales volume, your budget, the functions essential to your day-to-day operation, how easy it is for you and your teams to get to grips with the screen, the reliability of the supplier and the services it offers. For expert advice, contact us!<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_7069f698-8879-3d69-082d-d7e8e20c83f4-6643cc38" data-w-id="7069f698-8879-3d69-082d-d7e8e20c83f4" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How many tickets do you need a kitchen screen for?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A kitchen screen is recommended as soon as your fast-food restaurant processes more than 70/80 tickets a day. After that, we recommend 1 additional kitchen screen for every 80 tickets.For example, if your fast-food outlet processes 190 tickets/day, we recommend 2 kitchen screens, if it processes 240 tickets, we recommend 3 screens, etc.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-ae9b8bfb-779e-04bf-7520-41133882b46e-6643cc38" data-w-id="ae9b8bfb-779e-04bf-7520-41133882b46e" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What happens if I make a click error?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Our system includes an order history that allows you to put an order back on track.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-bf42859f-b059-a34b-94dc-311a92f3cbed-6643cc38" data-w-id="bf42859f-b059-a34b-94dc-311a92f3cbed" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Can you use several production screens to distribute orders?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, it's possible to dispatch orders between several screens, depending on the production station (grill, fries, pizza, etc.). This distribution ensures optimum fluidity and better organization of kitchen tasks.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
